{
"segs": [
{
"text": "It's nine AM, and you just woke up with the worst hangover of your life.",
"start": 0.06,
"end": 4.218249999999999,
"w0": 0
},
{
"text": "Flashes from last night: the zoo's late-night party.",
"start": 4.518249999999999,
"end": 7.430416666666666,
"w0": 15
},
{
"text": "Your girlfriend. It's over. Then nothing.",
"start": 7.630416666666666,
"end": 9.681291666666667,
"w0": 23
},
{
"text": "You stumble into the bathroom, and someone's in your bathtub.",
"start": 10.131291666666666,
"end": 13.047749999999999,
"w0": 29
},
{
"text": "Your hungover brain thinks: she came back.",
"start": 13.19775,
"end": 15.485791666666666,
"w0": 39
},
{
"text": "You lean in for a kiss.",
"start": 15.685791666666665,
"end": 16.853125,
"w0": 46
},
{
"text": "It's a penguin.",
"start": 17.273125,
"end": 18.10325,
"w0": 52
},
{
"text": "And it hits you right in the balls.",
"start": 18.28325,
"end": 19.904208333333333,
"w0": 55
},
{
"text": "It's real, it's angry, and your landlord inspects the flat at nine tonight.",
"start": 20.30420833333333,
"end": 24.421458333333334,
"w0": 63
},
{
"text": "Building rule number one: no pets. No exceptions.",
"start": 24.541458333333335,
"end": 27.435291666666668,
"w0": 76
},
{
"text": "That gives you twelve hours to make a penguin disappear.",
"start": 27.655291666666667,
"end": 30.60375,
"w0": 84
},
{
"text": "Problem one: it's starving. A penguin eats about half a kilo of fish a day.",
"start": 30.953750000000003,
"end": 35.315875000000005,
"w0": 94
},
{
"text": "Your fridge has one lemon and some ketchup.",
"start": 35.435875,
"end": 37.874,
"w0": 109
},
{
"text": "So at one o'clock, you buy every tin of sardines in the shop. The cashier doesn't ask. You don't explain.",
"start": 38.094,
"end": 44.08,
"w0": 117
},
{
"text": "Problem two: the noise. This is an African penguin, nicknamed the jackass penguin, because it calls exactly like a donkey.",
"start": 44.33,
"end": 51.49120833333333,
"w0": 137
},
{
"text": "At three, it starts calling.",
"start": 51.61120833333333,
"end": 52.98704166666666,
"w0": 157
},
{
"text": "Your neighbour bangs on the wall. Why is there a donkey in there?",
"start": 53.10704166666666,
"end": 56.379999999999995,
"w0": 162
},
{
"text": "So you blast a nature documentary, so the donkey noises have an alibi.",
"start": 56.599999999999994,
"end": 60.848124999999996,
"w0": 175
},
{
"text": "Except now the penguin thinks the TV is another penguin. And it's calling back. Louder.",
"start": 60.96812499999999,
"end": 66.01391666666666,
"w0": 188
},
{
"text": "Problem three: penguins don't aim. They fire their poop across the room.",
"start": 66.31391666666666,
"end": 70.16537499999998,
"w0": 203
},
{
"text": "Your bathroom has a new wall colour.",
"start": 70.28537499999999,
"end": 72.17441666666666,
"w0": 215
},
{
"text": "At five, you read the band on its flipper. City Zoo. Number forty-seven.",
"start": 72.47441666666666,
"end": 76.57783333333332,
"w0": 222
},
{
"text": "Then your ex texts: Did you take something from the zoo?",
"start": 76.69783333333332,
"end": 79.62466666666666,
"w0": 235
},
{
"text": "Breaking news: penguin stolen from City Zoo last night. Police are checking the car park cameras.",
"start": 79.87466666666666,
"end": 85.56566666666666,
"w0": 246
},
{
"text": "You still don't remember how. But your car keys are in the bathtub.",
"start": 85.68566666666666,
"end": 89.26325,
"w0": 262
},
{
"text": "Eight fifty-seven. Three knocks. Your landlord is early.",
"start": 89.76325,
"end": 92.80625,
"w0": 275
},
{
"text": "You can hide the penguin, or you can tell the truth.",
"start": 93.10625,
"end": 95.66520833333334,
"w0": 283
},
{
"text": "Comment hide or truth, and follow, because the most-liked answer decides part two.",
"start": 95.78520833333334,
"end": 100.72437500000001,
"w0": 294
}
],
